cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Causal-CDSS: Structural Causal Models for Clinical Decision Support Evaluation"
abstract: >-
  A seeded demonstration that a confounded ICU cohort can flip the sign of a
  treatment effect, and that backdoor adjustment and doubly-robust estimation
  recover it. The repository contains the reference implementation, a
  deterministic seed-42 driver that regenerates every reported estimate to
  committed CSVs, and the figure generators.
